h family living and entertaining. The main floor centres around a bright and spacious living room with a feature fireplace, alongside a fully fitted kitchen, separate utility room and guest WC. Two bedrooms are also located on this level, including the principal suite with a dressing area and en-suite bathroom. Air conditioning throughout ensures year-round comfort.\n\nThe lower floor has been thoughtfully arranged as a self-contained guest apartment, providing complete independence for family or visitors. It comprises three further bedrooms, three bathrooms, a second living room and an indoor kitchen with a barbecue area, creating the perfect space for extended stays or entertaining.\n\nOutside, beautifully landscaped gardens surround the property, offering complete privacy and a peaceful Mediterranean setting. A private swimming pool takes full advantage of the sunny climate, while spacious terraces capture panoramic sea views extending across the coastline towards Gibraltar. The property also benefits from a secure garage and a separate technical room providing pool equipment storage and additional practical space.\n\nOffering generous accommodation, versatile living and an enviable lifestyle location ‌within ‌walking ‌distance ‌of ‌the ‌beach and ‌marina, this ‌is a superb opportunity to ‌own ‌an ‌established ‌Marbella ‌home equally suited as ‌a ‌permanent ‌residence, ‌holiday ‌retreat ‌or ‌investment."},"features":{"es":["Cerca de Ciudad","Cerca de Colegios","Sur","Suroeste","Excelente","Privada","Aire Acondicionado","A/A Caliente","A/A Frio","Mar","Panorámicas","Jardín","Piscina","Terraza Cubierta","Armarios Empotrados","Terraza Privada","Aprtmnt. Huéspedes","Trastero","Lavadero","Baño En-Suite","Doble acristalamiento","Fibra óptica","Equipada","Privado","Subterráneo","Electricidad","Golf","Casas de vacaciónes","Inversion","Lujo","Reventa"],"en":["Close To Town","Close To Schools","South","South West","Excellent","Private","Air Conditioning","Hot A/C","Cold A/